---
title: Smoked Paprika Sweet Potatoes
course: side
servings: 2
time_active: 10
time_total: 40
leftovers: good
pairs: [argentine-beef-tenderloin-with-malbec-sauce]
---

Heat the oven to 400°F.

Peel @sweet potato{1}(large) and cut it into 1-inch cubes. Toss with @olive oil{1%tbsp}, @smoked paprika{1/2%tsp}, @salt, and @black pepper{}, and spread on a #baking sheet{}.

Roast until tender and caramelized, ~{25-30%minutes}, flipping halfway.

> If they finish early, turn off the oven and leave them in to stay warm.
